    "description": "Aurabloom VIP Crystal Club Collection - 42 Pieces\nNatural Stone Towers, Pyramids, Skulls, and Accessories\nMulti-Color Mineral Specimen Lot\nComprehensive 42-piece collection of decorative crystals featuring a wide variety of natural stone specimens in popular geometric cuts. This assembly includes an assortment of towers, obelisks, and pyramids, ranging from miniature points to large statement pieces. Sourced from the Aurabloom VIP Crystal Club, these pieces showcase a diverse spectrum of mineral types including amethyst, rose quartz, lapis lazuli, tiger's eye, and fluorite, perfect for collection, display, or crystal healing practices.\nPieces Included:\nLarge Black Obelisk - Approximately 6 inches tall with unique circular indentation\nAssorted Crystal Towers - Approximately 20 pieces including rose quartz, tiger's eye, rainbow fluorite, lapis lazuli, and moonstone\nCrystal Pyramids - 4 pieces including large black, small clear quartz, and green aventurine style specimens\nCarved Crystal Skulls - 1 opalite style and 1 miniature black skull carving\nSpecialized Specimens - 1 iridescent aura quartz cluster, 1 orange double-terminated point with gold moon/star decals, and various rough stones\nJewelry & Tools - 7-stone chakra hanging ornament, amethyst point pendant, and a crystal water bottle insert wand filled with amethyst chips\nBranded Accessories - 2 red satin Aurabloom pouches, 2 white fabric pouches, and collector insert card\nCondition:\nThe collection is in excellent overall condition. Polished towers, obelisks, and pyramids maintain crisp points and smooth facets with no significant structural damage or large chips. Natural rough specimens retain their original organic texture. All fabric pouches are clean and the chakra hanging remains fully intact. Total lot weight is 8.6 pounds.",
